	measure 'Data Prices Caption' =
			VAR vN = COUNTROWS(prices)
			VAR vFrom = MIN(prices[week_date])
			RETURN FORMAT(vN, "#,0") & " weeks since " & FORMAT(vFrom, "mmm yyyy") & ", newest first, c/L. The five parts add up to the pump price."
